  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This video demonstrates the issue here. The bottom screen is the world master.\nhttps://streamable.com/295jyr\nThis is some what difficult to reproduce because it doesn't seem to happen every time. The steps to reproduce are simple: visit a world with an AVPro player and wait for someone to desync (extra attention on the master). It can take a few minutes for it to be notice able so prepare a long video or many videos.\nThe video being played here is a YouTube video.",
